---
description: Enforce production-app-standard Policy/Check/Enforcement rules
alwaysApply: true
---

When writing or reviewing application code against this standard:

1. Follow `AGENTS.md` as a work contract (workflow + output contract).
2. Read `PRINCIPLES.md`: complexity must be earned; every dependency is a liability.
3. Use matching `docs/**` and `checklists/**` for the touched domain.
4. Treat P0 security/authz/backup/payment controls as blockers.
5. Never claim production ready / Gold unless `production-check` has no P0 FAIL and residual risk is listed.
6. Prefer fixing production gaps over feature chrome.
7. Never commit secrets, bypass authz, or skip migrations.
8. Map security work through `docs/security/ASVS_REGISTRY.md` when adding controls.
